                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, loza usoo chinyume cha mwango Seiri, na ulavye unabii chinyumeche, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawe uambe, ‘Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Lola, mimi ni chinyumecho, mwango Seiri, nami ndagolosa mkpwono wangu chinyumecho, nami ndakuhenda ukale gandzo huphu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaihenda midziyo ikale magandzo na urichwe wekee bila atu, nawe undamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala ukakala na uadui wa kpwenderera na kulavya Aiziraeli apigbwe na upanga wakati ariphophahwa ni shaka, wakati wao wa kutiywa adabu ya mwisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo kpwa sababu uwe kuyamena kuolaga atu asio na makosa, ndakuricha uolagbwe, kpwa hivyo aolagadzi andakuzoresa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahenda mwango Seiri ukale gandzo huphu nami ndaolaga atu atsupirao na hipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myangoyo ndaiodzaza atu arioolagbwa. Aho arioolagbwa na upanga andagbwa mo mwako vidzangoni, madeteni na mwako vidzuhoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakuhenda ukale gandzo ta kare na kare na midziyo taindasagala atu. Namwi mundamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mana uwe waamba, “Tsi ya mataifa gaga mairi indakala yangu nami ndaihala,” dzagbwe mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu kala ni phapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, kpwa kpweli dza niishivyo, nindakuhenda kulengana na tsukizi na wivu uriouonyesa kpwa sababu ya kuamenako. Mimi ndadzimanyisa kahi yao wakati ndiphokuamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe undamanya kukala mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, nkasikira kulaphiza kosi urikogomba chinyume cha myango ya Iziraeli, uriphoamba, “Ikahendwa magandzo na nikahewa mimi niibanange.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadzikarya na uchiderereka chinyume changu nami nchisikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Ndakuhenda wekee bila atu, wakati atu osi a dunia anahererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dza urivyohererwa wakati Iziraeli iriphohendwa wekee bila atu, ndivyo ndivyokuhendera uwe. Uwe undakala wekee, uwe mwango Seiri na tsi yosi ya Edomu. Phahi atu andamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
